      "message": "I also use a build without v8 (that\u0027s the default, right)? (What does disabling v8 help with? Startup time?)\n\nMy use case is that I want to check if and how much some of my patches hurt drawing performance. I figured I\u0027d run `pdfium_test some-file-using-some-feature.pdf` under either hyperfine or Instruments.app. But rendering takes less time than running static initializers. It\u0027s close to the sampling rate of Instruments.app and high-noise. If I add `--render-repeats\u003d50`, I get much more reliable numbers.",
